having paid all that money

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:26.140
and I didn't make any money.

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.900
So I owed money.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:30.470
And that sucks when you're on stage,

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:31.530
people are staring at you.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:33.550
You're not getting payed for
everything that you're doing.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.200
You're getting all bruised and everything.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:37.033
It's awful.

00:09:37.033 --> 00:09:38.210
So not having that for sure money

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:40.630
sometimes really sucks.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:41.691
- [Interviewer] Wow, I had no idea.

00:09:41.691 --> 00:09:42.774
- Yeah. Yeah.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:46.990
- [Interviewer] And, does it affect your

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:48.301
personal relationships?

00:09:48.301 --> 00:09:50.620
Like romantic relations?

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:54.680
- I mean, yes and no, but I
have the wherewithal to know

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:56.880
that those people are not worth my time.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:10:00.390
And I've kind of found my
friend group within it.

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:03.260
I had, the boyfriend, at
the time when I started,

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:05.380
when he found out he broke up with me.

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.660
And at the time it was devastating,

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:09.810
but I was just like, (beep) that guy.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:13.850
Like, he's so lame,
but I've lost only like

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:14.770
one friendship over it,

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:16.530
but she was like really super religious.

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.302
So I kind of expected it of her.

00:10:18.302 --> 00:10:20.250
Yeah. But really honestly,

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:23.464
it hasn't really changed much of my life.

00:10:23.464 --> 00:10:25.012
- [Interviewer] Excellent.

00:10:25.012 --> 00:10:26.350
Well Rebekkah, thank you
so much for talking to me.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.183
- Thank you.

00:10:27.183 --> 00:10:28.016
- [Interviewer] And good
luck with everything.

00:10:28.016 --> 00:10:28.849
- Thank you.

00:10:28.849 --> 00:10:30.209
- [Interviewer] For the future.

